'''Ritual Drum Doge''' (やぐらわんこ, ''Yagurawanko'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]].

